+# Part-settle an OPEN claim, first step: refuse it (writing nothing, not even an audit line) when a split of the amount would be refused, or when the settle button would refuse the user's settle of the claim; else split the amount off exactly as a split does and answer the new claim, which the screen then settles exactly as the settle button does.
